{"unit_id":"Perfirstvito__dsh-compaction-micro#card-zh","repo":"Perfirstvito/dsh-compaction-micro","commit":"e0df7557e18d611d340c884c143ce2472929cdff","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-compaction-micro 是一个面向 DeepSeek Harness 的上下文清理插件，通过 Cordis 服务监听 agent 步骤和上下文溢出事件。它按配置的工具白名单将较旧的工具结果替换成提示模型可重新调用工具的占位内容，并为替换记录 compaction/prune 事件；可设置保留最近结果数、触发比例和预留 token 数。适合希望在正式摘要压缩前先回收可重跑工具输出的 DSH 使用者。需配置适合清理的工具白名单；插件不会自行验证工具是否只读或可重跑。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:104-151","src/index.ts:173-210"]}
{"unit_id":"Perfirstvito__dsh-compaction-micro#card-en","repo":"Perfirstvito/dsh-compaction-micro","commit":"e0df7557e18d611d340c884c143ce2472929cdff","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-compaction-micro clears older configured tool results to free DeepSeek Harness context. It listens before steps and on context overflow, replaces eligible results with rerun markers, and records prune events. Configure a whitelist and retention threshold; it does not verify tools are rerunnable.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:104-151","src/index.ts:173-210"]}
