{"unit_id":"Perfirstvito__dsh-compaction-micro#feature-1","repo":"Perfirstvito/dsh-compaction-micro","commit":"e0df7557e18d611d340c884c143ce2472929cdff","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-compaction-micro 的功能「按白名单清理工具结果」：调用 clearSession 时扫描会话表面上的工具结果，按工具调用名称筛选，并把较旧结果替换为提示可重新运行的占位文本，同时保留配置数量的最新结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:104-151"]}
{"unit_id":"Perfirstvito__dsh-compaction-micro#feature-2","repo":"Perfirstvito/dsh-compaction-micro","commit":"e0df7557e18d611d340c884c143ce2472929cdff","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-compaction-micro 的功能「阈值自动清理」：agent/pre-step 事件中读取当前路由模型的上下文窗口并测量 token；达到配置比例后清理白名单结果。缺少模型窗口信息或白名单为空时不清理。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:157-171","src/index.ts:187-200"]}
{"unit_id":"Perfirstvito__dsh-compaction-micro#feature-3","repo":"Perfirstvito/dsh-compaction-micro","commit":"e0df7557e18d611d340c884c143ce2472929cdff","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-compaction-micro 的功能「溢出时先尝试清理」：收到上下文窗口溢出错误时尝试清除白名单结果，再将事件交给后续处理器；清理异常不会阻断后续恢复流程。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:202-210"]}
